  "notes": "First-party render, same shape as the golden-case reference rasters already tracked in design-lab/evals/: this PNG is the project's own Workbench, screenshotted by the theme-affordance gate after it clicked the shipped palette control. No third-party input, so sourceId is null and the owner-approved exception carries the re-verification interval. modelInputAllowed stays false for THIS evidence: it is a record of what a gate observed, and feeding gate output back into a model is exactly the loop this repository's E-level ladder exists to prevent. The gate never wrote a sidecar because the file used to be untracked; tracking it under owner item G (2026-10-12, option A) is what made DL-AST-001 apply."
